  "description": "Ba-Reum’s planner might be full, but one thing she desperately needs in her diary is a date. When she is lured into joining a programming club by her friend’s hot coworker, it looks like there might be hope for her. But will her inexperience lead to her downfall? And why does she keep running into his bad-tempered friend instead? \n\n(Source: WEBTOON, edited)\n\n*Note: Includes six extra chapters.*",
